# Payments for SFD.DJ Plus and Premium (Stripe). Until these are filled in, Settings -> Plus says "Payments are not connected yet".
# 1. Make a Stripe account (stripe.com). Start with Test mode to try it without real money.
# 2. STRIPE_SECRET = Developers -> API keys -> Secret key (sk_test_... or, when you go live, sk_live_...).
# 3. STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET = Developers -> Webhooks -> Add endpoint https://YOUR-SITE/stripe/webhook with the events
#    customer.subscription.created, customer.subscription.updated and customer.subscription.deleted -> Signing secret (whsec_...).
# 4. Settings -> Billing -> Customer portal: switch it on, so people can cancel and change their card.
# Then take the # off the two lines below and paste the keys after the =.
# STRIPE_SECRET=
# STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=